[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:137. A Pleasant Dream]
[00:00.120]Lesson 137 | 第137课
[00:02.940]Are you doing the football pools, Brian? | 布莱恩，你在玩足球博彩吗？
[00:06.585]Yes, I've nearly finished, June. | 是的，我快完成了，琼。
[00:09.470]I'm sure we shall win something this week. | 我相信我们这周会赢点什么。
[00:12.745]You always say that, but we never win anything. | 你总是这么说，但我们从来没赢过任何东西。
[00:18.020]What will you do if you win a lot of money? | 如果你赢了很多钱，你会做什么？
[00:21.855]If I win a lot of money, | 如果我赢了很多钱，
[00:24.765]I shall buy you a mink coat. | 我就给你买一件貂皮大衣。
[00:27.555]I don't want a mink coat. | 我不想要貂皮大衣。
[00:30.430]I want to see the world. | 我想去看看世界。
[00:32.595]All right. If we win a lot of money, | 好的。如果我们赢了很多钱，
[00:35.950]we shall travel round the world | 我们就环游世界，
[00:38.290]and we shall stay at the best hotels. | 我们会住最好的酒店。
[00:41.555]Then we shall return home | 然后我们回家，
[00:44.205]and buy a big house in the country. | 在乡下买一栋大房子。
[00:46.740]We shall have a beautiful garden and | 我们会有一个漂亮的花园，而且——
[00:49.974]But if we spend all that money, | 但如果我们把所有的钱都花光了，
[00:53.160]we shall be poor again. | 我们就会再次变穷。
[00:55.465]What shall we do then? | 那我们该怎么办呢？
[00:57.605]If we spend all the money, | 如果我们把所有的钱都花光了，
[00:59.955]we shall try and win the football pools again. | 我们就再试着赢足球博彩。
[01:03.285]It's a pleasant dream, | 这是个美梦，
[01:05.510]but everything depends on 'if'. | 但一切都取决于“如果”。